From e52c4a98e02a9bf08d83a478f02282f1fb17efcd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 15:05:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 21/34] Static legendary beasts and visible markers for
 sprite-less legendaries

- No roaming beast: Celio no longer starts the roamer and roamer encounters
  are disabled; Raikou, Entei and Suicune are the static encounters
- Regis, Kyogre, Groudon, Rayquaza, Latias, Latios and Jirachi are marked by
  the Birth Island meteorite rock instead of invisible tiles (Kyogre's moved
  onto the shore so it can be talked to)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
